\eqn{g(\mu_{i,t}) = x_{i,t}'\beta + \sum_k f_k(s_i,t) + } offset, where each
scale-\eqn{k} field \eqn{f_k} couples a per-knot AR(1) Kalman smoother in time
with kernel kriging in space.
